{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62d99ec8f6d131ae5b639249067b7cda6febd5e711a5c8470a2bb9315172bba2",
      "text": "Nimbus! Alk! Strip, no questions\nasked!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:418d70b2931aeee0c28112c4daaa192a196a6d964237216452b8f26293b1c893",
      "text": "Here we go...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9098515e65fd58dd8fde0b202ac69874d66f5a2c83b43a8275be9f52dc700811",
      "text": "...So what is it this time?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c3926f13fd09ad1535f9ed0b729051228b431af885af304b12536ec8a5ee7b98",
      "text": "It means what it says?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:94f3098f215c52122fc561b9ca6980a12ef5a6434e600afe895f641f1facd3bd",
      "text": "No, skip the bit.\nGet to the point.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f49006ab51ce27774f3cbc5b71e836bf4a084544ab953915a9f64d8f7250f3ef",
      "text": "Aw, you're no fun.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cfc54f4d56ff9a23ef6d2d62bd89af5b3a085ec861c2972e58597fb29df9fb79",
      "text": "It's about helping someone. I want\nyou to bare your skin for them.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "37": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:71b51df400dfdd252f3e2824f3bbfcfddd926158c8514c297369940a3dcf2112",
      "text": "Oh... that kind of 'strip'...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "41": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:530d379361b084252af80ba7dd6764a4ba23e08eb66adcaee4e010c2eb2b1109",
      "text": "Really now... What kind of\ndelusions did you have?\nYou two are so indecent.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3c03b5b4a691ac7e757fcc9b3a26322516531003dbc6db68db9e608bbb483eb8",
      "text": "What do I do, she's\nreally annoying...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:460ce2943bf855e975e536a99820a9d2efe36309309faf86843c36f8594e5d81",
      "text": "Aw? Come on, let's play! It's more\nfun together! Right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1244f998de04f87d120d6af0f22c7cb6fb9d46f0afc9110684c99f926a89c1a",
      "text": "He wants us to be his\ntraining partners...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7013aec193dc46a1d9a62ac57c5d2a137bbfde497cd27194872826e5c3bc81dd",
      "text": "Right, right. This kid runs a dojo in\ntown, and was even engaged to a\nstudent. Everything was going so well.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "63": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bee2ae4bab812553c12ff3f753b009cdeff8b3711109167e372ae15c80ec48d9",
      "text": "But, but...!! That woman!! She found\nsomeone stronger than me and went\nto them!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a2dec8432e85e010b63b74b0b53560a1b67322c433e84d87d68606961cbf171f",
      "text": "Oh... I see. Well, my condolences.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b2d9e503608587c2d037d2d1d0af444fb243fdea096d4214d6cb6251bff826f",
      "text": "Hey, why are we involved...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d0c7bbd019f2f3a8d4cc18be94fb31067be74905a50f47a35a38f24614cbcf65",
      "text": "His lover was taken, his pride was\nshattered, and he's in tatters, body\nand soul.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:106823300fa5a3725c8530533bb380e44a749d5a5f888ba302b9ad226def25af",
      "text": "Isn't that so adorable... I mean,\npitiful? Don't you want to help him?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4b402ec038eb175f712a81b01a9e9aca681649c99aea25448a5e4de8d34d5b6",
      "text": "Besides, I want to do fun things with\nfriends! So won't you join me?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d93096113fb7a259d3e6d79b17682005f3af652b9a1fa340a262362fda940ec5",
      "text": "Please...!! They say that guy is evil\nstrong, and all our dojo's best\nfighters ended up in the hospital...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f063134d6c3c77c8d0def4fd7b78c931e080882f7ac3f16edf4f6b5eb87a6082",
      "text": "So I want to avenge them, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ca0991bcbb48ecf7fee435fa6a8a68c4871f11870e1df2c6a4b49eb0fff6cbe3",
      "text": "Well, hmm... Setting aside the love\npart, if it's about violence, then\nmaybe...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:29df486d92672d8b5bd841febcceb8b2613bc82735bbe8a43cdc0e567d5db5f0",
      "text": "Thank you so much!! Just you watch,\nyou home-wrecker...! I'll win her\nback, I swear...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "95": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97d9ba31aa87f783318a6bcb70850f83aec6f27ca7fe45821f4990fd20e90550",
      "text": "So that's the real goal...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "100": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39f2d8afd502c4197d1d9346e2c5aa903ddc81bb9687d6a5e9cc21364220a6f6",
      "text": "Haa, haa...!! This is it! Rumor has\nit my fiancee and the loathsome\ndojo crasher are here...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3a4f985fdbb12e2d108b07cb83d119c79d597c0f5c4b01332fdcf4d84392b04f",
      "text": "Calm down for now. Rushing won't do\nyou any good.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:31a287972ad6a7290d6a7f1fac6e5a36dd3e03fa0ff26a7cfbcf99fad6b75ed8",
      "text": "Well, we're in it now. I'll back you\nup a bit.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3bf9f716d868e50d656f85119605eee22c5291e660eac58a584666d1746c6c98",
      "text": "Thank you! Then, right away...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4c596a76373aef1ddd257f3e16a5f8cf58d4c74bbd2c35eba6ed152f6d8e0802",
      "text": "Excuse me...! I've come to take\nback my bride...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:08202a2ef59ffdcb16d3e6b04f1699fa631ebcdb94dc8acf2bbd6f394596eaf1",
      "text": "Oh, you're late, aren't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "121": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a24622043399695a1b197e011307ec56be2cf226f10ebd12e5c56926dc6c9516",
      "text": "We were fools to take this person\nseriously...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b544e4382667831bc5ca88959107f8eb1833b3a402a16af60472f92efdc39dbc",
      "text": "M-Master...!? What's going on...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:209201e1a80714d4806c651dd07bddf070a64e02b0af2637fa3de66adc502621",
      "text": "Heh... well, you know. Why don't you\nsay it yourself?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d91897909c918c7e67bb47b3eee208c08c1554ddca8c6c008ea0d5f48acd7d39",
      "text": "I-it's a lie, isn't it...!? You and\nMaster... no...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ac71173994665323e4e2d59e64778c5dd7ce6db681db096e20a7ad962cb3574c",
      "text": "...I'm sorry. But I've already given\neverything to Lady Tanakiela.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:90ada6d84530d9972545536f01ad34c9bd5261cc2f1a8e95545d29b70950205c",
      "text": "And this person is amazing. She's\nstrong, and above all understands me\nbetter than anyone!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c65c99bb9f1832bc23f7db110df6816bc516c4115bc6a3dcbeb2dee01578a7ce",
      "text": "Yes, the archrival you hated was the\nvery me you confided in so sincerely.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e04e4f3435ede3aab26c26ca10629b2eb9424071d05cae368f63c5bf03a61a7e",
      "text": "Hey, how does it feel?? The master\nyou trusted was your enemy. Are you\naroused? Jealous? About to cry?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "144": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a06eab7d8f511e2f2c27f3e08ab614170088989f2081df0bac2d4169ee9c75c1",
      "text": "N-no way...! It can't\nbe... a lie...!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3beb0c5f8cf020c627f5fcca03341b5b2c8c49a29869990943afead2fe140a32",
      "text": "...That's cruel, isn't it!?\nAlk! Nimbus! Say something!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:baa5364981d15eaccc015205b1dc7a6d0d683e98545e1818cefc23d432715c2b",
      "text": "Well... who she falls in love with is\nup to her, I think... I'm sure it's\nhard, though...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a8c167e530768e29a1b2ce85b881bd9f3a49612c3883891f84e2cc72a4db0ff1",
      "text": "Can I go home now?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1570eb331bbe916913e435d38af5ad605409d9b93b86a8b75f77fc9923859a0c",
      "text": "No interest at all!! Come on, isn't\nthis kind of thing fun!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83e3a216d26e4015e110421921c7b3ceab348388c1d1831aa200bce2b3afcc3d",
      "text": "An explosion of emotion makes a\nperson strong! Isn't it a joy to\nwitness that moment?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "167": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d1c714b83c48330d5b768f264d6f5b94d3d43c6828ba5127722d6794a0256e5f",
      "text": "Well, I'd rather not get\ninvolved, honestly...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:16465cb752bede5a9f44a6e746a9eea03a2c6e2385a557602c36d389cc3f5184",
      "text": "How dare you... how dare you...!!\nP-prepare yourself!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62b245f7a8d697a43bd2551b3d614f45ec9e65872402d92189c85ee59b4f416c",
      "text": "Yes! That face! That emotion!!\nWith that, you can grow stronger,\nand stronger still!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dfcf09b1b4d1d63933931aab3fa6d6e81759ebb39fd0c8b0690f98b4c03c1bde",
      "text": "But it's still not enough!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad36f2395b07a47ada2c2c2ff8ed91eed56a7e7d63244cadab44915a3b30e494",
      "text": "Bwaaaah!?!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a40dc8d811bef0e8b84be4899d01259006ff5438ca435fd617d7d0daba38f5c1",
      "text": "Ugh... w-what was that\npower just now...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aa1a702774188a44cb5ec4262bfef71ab7ddbb29b51f4d4c64f826f50931d5fb",
      "text": "Heh... Looks like you noticed.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f2d43bb35583a7551db2e0055ccdd4ca1a59b33290e5a7834d8a87a0ec97480c",
      "text": "Strength of feeling is what makes a\nperson strong. Yet without realizing\nit, you were suppressing your heart...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dbd7257d9cc9fb4c4e7f5a40b5f6ec8bc5364d049a8d5dba9e2ea40c15a8c5f9",
      "text": "But now you see, don't\nyou? That power just now\nis your true power...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:03488e14be73e517ea4ba50f1de7b8a1c570fd6e29098949102dbc93a5a5e0f8",
      "text": "Don't tell me... you did it to teach\nme that...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "199": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:297e413e7809049047a211fe22a3f9e4a3946f3fc47bc6f2e8ec6bda60b959b7",
      "text": "Exactly!! If you want to be\nstrong, get even more messed\nup!! Make your heart go mad!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2d5b7da7873db2cb1a6abb4466af8708117277592c45c0d3af38ee639981b21a",
      "text": "And challenge me as many times as\nyou like!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e29bd89c16bbfae9b6880b6c6d3899b03afee4e61f4ddf9cbe011d40a49cbb69",
      "text": "Thank you so much...!! I'll get\neven stronger...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8a2948081529108a82d3abfe88e5719f6b2a519cc34cf00078492df60dfb23ab",
      "text": "It sounds like a nice story,\nbut isn't it the worst from\nstart to finish??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bc4222f4c1c131a8917bfb057b085bea409eb14396724b77795797b749e72571",
      "text": "Fine, whatever. Do what you want...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c68e508a402647bb22799e3afc5597dedb8a0c40883a5ebd69f4f94bd87a48c8",
      "text": "Don't act like you're not involved!\nAlk, Nimbus! I leave his training to\nyou from now on!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc3ba2bdd41c7d56f7fc9562e1b2f294aac7df81e8d51fbe2dc04fd401580806",
      "text": "Why? You don't need us.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d2544bddb0297d60fff38c1ff3207d67b4e72e7cb2b22607882b4bc4ff2d4ec4",
      "text": "I told you at the start,\ndidn't I? I want to do\nfun things with friends!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
